    "media:imagetext": "atoomba, city of the Blue\nMountains in New South Wales.\noffers a trio of curious crags.\nStanding 1000 feet above the\nJamieson Valley, these \"Three\nSisters\" command a sweep of\nred and ochre cliffs... mist.\ndeepened bowls of cobalt blue.\nPan American serves the\nSouth Pacific through Nandi\nin the Fiji Islands, Sydney in\nAustralia and through Auckland\nin New Zealand.\nThis mena is one of a complete set, suitable for framing.\nwich may be obtained by aviting to: Serice manager.\nPacife. Alaska Dicision, Pan American World Airways,\nInc.. Internattonal Airport, San Francisco. California",
